  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "ACK cluster container security policies provide a rich set of built-in rule libraries, including Compliance, Infra, K8s-general, and PSP, to ensure the secure operation of containers in production environments. You can call the DescribePolicyGovernanceInCluster operation to query detailed policy governance information for a specified cluster, such as the count of enabled policies at different severity levels, policy governance audit logs, and interception and alert details",
